X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering Rashi\, whose 922nd Yahrzeit o
 ccurs on Tuesday\, July 27\, corresponding to the 22nd of Tamuz\, 5787.\n\
 nRashi’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Monday\, July 26 and continues un
 til sundown on the day of observance. It is customary to light a memorial 
 candle at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your loved one’s soul be b
 ound up in the bond of eternal life and may their memory serve as a contin
 ued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
